# ZTron Quantum Teleportation Protocol
# Qubit 0: Payload (State to Teleport)
# Qubit 1: Alice Entangled Pair
# Qubit 2: Bob Entangled Pair

INIT 3
PRINT

# Step 1: Prepare Payload on Qubit 0 (Apply X to set state to |1>)
X 0

# Step 2: Create Entangled Pair between Alice (Q1) and Bob (Q2)
H 1
CNOT 1 2

# Step 3: Alice performs Bell measurement on Payload (Q0) and Her Qubit (Q1)
CNOT 0 1
H 0
PRINT

# Step 4: System Measurement & Teleportation Collapse
MEASURE
PRINT